									<span>
										{patient.daysSinceLastVisit <= 0
											? "╨Х╤Й╤С ╨╜╨╡ ╨▒╤Л╨╗ ╨╜╨░ ╨┐╤А╨╕╤С╨╝╨╡ ╨╕╨╗╨╕ ╨▓╨╕╨╖╨╕╤В ╤Б╨╡╨│╨╛╨┤╨╜╤П"
